  "body": "We document the individual configuration parameters in https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/usage/configuration/config_documentation.html?highlight=monthly#limit_usage_by_mau, but it would be good to have a separate document stating how the system works at a high level. \r\n\r\nIn particular, I'd like to see:\r\n\r\n- How activity is calculated.\r\n- How the \"trial period\" works.\r\n- How users (including deactivated) users may fall out of that activity period.\r\n- When the user limit is reached, what services/endpoints are blocked by the homeserver.\r\n\r\nIt would be good to have this from the point of view of having something to point at when someone asks how it works.",
